&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in Python, SQL, and Apache Spark.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building scalable batch and real-time ETL/ELT pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with AWS services including EMR, S3, Glue, and Athena.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Kafka, Flink, or Kinesis for streaming data processing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of dimensional modeling, Data Vault, and data warehousing concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Delta Lake, Apache Iceberg, or Apache Hudi.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in workflow orchestration using Airflow.&lt;/li&gt;
