&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2090&quot; data-end=&quot;2493&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1leeji5&quot; data-start=&quot;2090&quot; data-end=&quot;2211&quot;&gt;Support execution of product marketing strategies and go-to-market initiatives aligned to portfolio growth objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;10mfld2&quot; data-start=&quot;2212&quot; data-end=&quot;2320&quot;&gt;Partner with senior marketing leadership to ensure consistency across launches, campaigns, and messaging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1a74b4u&quot; data-start=&quot;2321&quot; data-end=&quot;2413&quot;&gt;Contribute to launch readiness by developing messaging, materials, and supporting assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;s517a5&quot; data-start=&quot;2414&quot; data-end=&quot;2493&quot;&gt;Coordinate cross-functional inputs to ensure aligned execution across teams&lt;/li&gt;
