&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Participate in and drive leadership &lt;/strong&gt;in sales meetings, customer &amp;amp; partner meetings, and industry events by being &lt;strong&gt;field first and in person&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive differentiation for Portworx by developing and executing integrated &lt;strong&gt;go-to-market plans&lt;/strong&gt; and staying ahead of competitive trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead operational excellence initiatives, including sales enablement, process improvement, and readiness programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track success metrics across pipeline generation, communications, and marketing activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead by example living the Pure Values:&amp;nbsp; Persistence, Creativity, Teamwork, Ownership and Customer-first&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience &lt;strong&gt;leading high-growth software sales teams&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally in SaaS or cloud-native technology environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in first line leadership roles: Managing ICs and establishing operational best practices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record of building and executing &lt;strong&gt;territory and go-to-market strategies&lt;/strong&gt; that scale over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the &lt;strong&gt;cloud-native and Kubernetes ecosystem&lt;/strong&gt;, DevOps, open-source software, and application modernisation.&lt;/li&gt;
