&lt;li&gt;Strong program management and communication skills, with the ability to align teams and measure impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing partners, vendors, and cross-functional initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, inclusive leadership style with excellent influencing and decision-making abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for customer success, innovation, and building high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
