&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We’re looking for a bright and passionate Software Team Lead to join our R&amp;amp;D Client team.&lt;br&gt;In this critical role, you will lead, design, and develop our client solutions for Linux and Android, as well as our Digital Experience Monitoring solution across all OS platforms.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a team of experienced software engineers, fostering a culture of ownership, excellence, and mutual support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take end-to-end ownership of solutions throughout the full design and development lifecycle, including significant cross-team collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with multiple stakeholders, including Product Management, server teams, core networking teams, and others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, implement, and test enterprise network security solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up to date with relevant client-side technologies to enable new capabilities, support innovative solutions, and continuously improve the product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research new technologies and adopt them where they can add value to the company’s product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience as a Team Lead in a Linux/Windows environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of hands-on software development experience in C/C++.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth knowledge of networking, network protocols, and network environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of owning full product lifecycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent leadership, communication, and collaboration skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.Sc. in Computer Science or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advantages&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of Android frameworks - significant advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with macOS development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with identity providers, OAuth2, SSO, and authentication flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
