&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Join our Growing Team!&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We have a Full Time Registered Nurse &lt;/strong&gt;opportunity available&amp;nbsp;now doing Home Health Visits throughout Medina County&lt;strong&gt;. &lt;/strong&gt;This role requires recent Med/Surg experience and strong wound-care skills to support home health clients.&lt;/h3&gt;
